================================================================
  LANGKAH-LANGKAH HOSTING RUANG RAPAT IoT KE PYTHONANYWHERE
  Project  : ruang-rapatv4 (Flask + Three.js + ESP32)
  URL      : http://galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com
  GitHub   : https://github.com/GalangMakara/ruanganiotflask
================================================================


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  BAGIAN A — UPLOAD KODE KE GITHUB (dari laptop)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Langkah A1 — Buat repo di GitHub
  - Buka https://github.com dan login
  - Klik tombol "New" → beri nama repo: ruanganiotflask
  - Klik "Create repository"

Langkah A2 — Inisialisasi Git di folder project (laptop)
  Buka terminal di folder ruang-rapatv4, lalu jalankan:

    git init
    git add .
    git commit -m "siap deploy ke PythonAnywhere"
    git branch -M main
    git remote add origin https://github.com/GalangMakara/ruanganiotflask.git
    git push -u origin main

  Catatan:
  - Saat push, akan muncul popup login GitHub → sign in lewat browser
  - Kalau minta token: buka github.com/settings/tokens → Generate new
    token (classic) → centang scope "repo" → copy token → paste
    sebagai password saat push
  - File myenv/ dan __pycache__/ otomatis diabaikan karena ada .gitignore


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  BAGIAN B — SETUP SERVER DI PYTHONANYWHERE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Langkah B1 — Daftar/Login PythonAnywhere
  - Buka https://www.pythonanywhere.com
  - Daftar akun gratis (username = galangmakara)
  - Domain otomatis: galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com

Langkah B2 — Clone repo & install dependencies
  Di PythonAnywhere → tab Consoles → klik Bash, lalu jalankan:

    git clone https://github.com/GalangMakara/ruanganiotflask.git ~/ruang-rapatv4
    mkvirtualenv --python=/usr/bin/python3.13 ruangvenv
    pip install -r ~/ruang-rapatv4/requirements.txt

  Catatan:
  - Prompt berubah jadi (ruangvenv)$ setelah mkvirtualenv → virtualenv aktif
  - Kalau python3.13 tidak tersedia, coba python3.12 (samakan di langkah B4)

Langkah B3 — Buat Web App
  - Klik tab Web → "Add a new web app"
  - Pilih: Manual configuration (BUKAN yang "Flask")
  - Pilih: Python 3.13
  - Klik Next sampai selesai

Langkah B4 — Set Source Code
  Di halaman konfigurasi Web App, bagian "Code":
  - Klik tulisan merah "Enter the path to your web app source code"
  - Isi: /home/galangmakara/ruang-rapatv4
  - Tekan Enter

Langkah B5 — Set Virtualenv
  Di halaman yang sama, bagian "Virtualenv":
  - Klik area input → ketik: ruangvenv → tekan Enter
  - Akan expand jadi: /home/galangmakara/.virtualenvs/ruangvenv

Langkah B6 — Edit File WSGI
  Di bagian "Code", klik link biru file WSGI:
    /var/www/galangmakara_pythonanywhere_com_wsgi.py

  Hapus SEMUA isi file, lalu paste kode berikut:

    import sys

    project_home = '/home/galangmakara/ruang-rapatv4'
    if project_home not in sys.path:
        sys.path.insert(0, project_home)

    from app import app as application  # noqa

  Klik Save (pojok kanan atas editor)

Langkah B7 — Pastikan Force HTTPS = OFF
  Di tab Web, cari toggle "Force HTTPS" → pastikan MATI (OFF)
  PENTING: kalau nyala, ESP32 akan error saat kirim data karena
  urequests MicroPython tidak support redirect ke HTTPS

Langkah B8 — Reload & Test
  - Klik tombol hijau "Reload galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com"
  - Buka browser: http://galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com
  - Dashboard 3D harus tampil dengan status ONLINE


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  BAGIAN C — SETUP ESP32
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Langkah C1 — Konfigurasi file ESP32 (di laptop)
  Edit esp32/main.py:
    FLASK_HOST = "http://galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com"

  Edit esp32/boot.py:
    SSID = "BOE-"   # WiFi kantor BOE, open network tanpa password
    (gunakan wlan.connect(SSID) tanpa argumen password)

Langkah C2 — Upload ke ESP32
  - Colok ESP32 ke laptop via kabel USB
  - Buka Thonny → pilih interpreter MicroPython (ESP32)
  - Upload esp32/boot.py → simpan sebagai boot.py di ESP32
  - Upload esp32/main.py → simpan sebagai main.py di ESP32
  - Klik Stop/Restart atau tekan tombol Reset di ESP32

  Di Thonny shell akan muncul:
    [WiFi] Terhubung! IP: 192.168.x.x
    [Main] ESP32 Ruang Rapat siap.
    [Sensor] Suhu: 27°C  Kelembapan: 60%

Langkah C3 — Deploy ESP32 tanpa laptop
  - Cabut USB dari laptop
  - Colok ESP32 ke charger HP (kepala cas) atau power bank
  - ESP32 otomatis nyalakan boot.py → connect WiFi BOE-
  - ESP32 otomatis kirim data sensor ke server tiap 3 detik
  - Laptop tidak diperlukan lagi


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  BAGIAN D — UPDATE KODE (jika ada perubahan)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Langkah D1 — Push perubahan dari laptop
  Di terminal laptop (folder ruang-rapatv4):

    git add .
    git commit -m "deskripsi perubahan"
    git push

Langkah D2 — Pull & reload di PythonAnywhere
  Di PythonAnywhere → tab Consoles → Bash:

    cd ~/ruang-rapatv4 && git pull

  Lalu klik tab Web → Reload galangmakara.pythonanywhere.com

Langkah D3 — Update kode ESP32
  - Edit file di laptop
  - Colok ESP32 ke laptop via USB
  - Upload ulang lewat Thonny


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  CATATAN PENTING
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1. LOGIN BULANAN
   PythonAnywhere free tier menonaktifkan web setelah 1 bulan
   tanpa login. Login ke pythonanywhere.com lalu klik:
   "Run until 1 month from today" di tab Web.
   PythonAnywhere akan kirim email pengingat seminggu sebelumnya.

2. FORCE HTTPS = OFF
   Selalu pastikan Force HTTPS dalam keadaan MATI di tab Web.
   ESP32 menggunakan HTTP, bukan HTTPS.

3. WiFi ESP32
   WiFi yang dipakai ESP32 (BOE-) HARUS punya akses internet
   agar bisa mengirim data ke pythonanywhere.com.

4. SATU WEB APP GRATIS
   Akun gratis hanya bisa hosting 1 web app.
   Untuk lebih dari 1, buat akun baru atau upgrade berbayar.

5. FILE WSGI
   Jika kode error setelah update, cek error log di:
   tab Web → Log files → Error log

